\ s+ takes x from X and y from Y (HP order)
all
1 2 s+ 3 5 s+ 4 4 s+ 2 7 s+
.s clst
mean .s clst
sdev .s clst
corr .
lr .s clst
10 yhat .
3 xhat .
\ remove a point and add it back: results must match
4 4 s- drop 4 4 s+ drop
mean .s clst
statscalc
clstat mean
5 5 s+ drop sdev
\ large offset: Welford keeps precision where the sum-of-squares formula fails
clstat
1e9 1e9 s+ drop 1e9 1 + 1e9 1 + s+ drop 1e9 2 + 1e9 2 + s+ drop
sdev .s
